speechtext:
Mr. Speaker, perhaps I did not hear part of the announcement made by the Prime Minister, but I did not hear any date mentioned in the
[Mr. Hees.}
announcement. May I ask the right hon. gentleman when the resignation of the Minister of Transport is to become effective, and if it becomes effective immediately, would the right hon. gentleman inform us who has been put in charge of housing in the meantime, pending the appointment of another minister?
